*.modules
*.version

# Unreal Engine 自动备份
**/Developers/
**/Collections/
**/__ExternalActors__/
**/__ExternalObjects__/

# Web / Node.js
/source/clients/web/**/node_modules/
/source/clients/web/**/.next/
/source/clients/web/**/.nuxt/
/source/clients/web/**/.svelte-kit/
/source/clients/web/**/dist/
/source/clients/web/**/build/
/source/clients/web/**/coverage/
/source/clients/web/**/.cache/
/source/clients/web/**/.parcel-cache/
/source/clients/web/**/.turbo/
/source/server/**/node_modules/
/source/server/**/dist/
/source/server/**/build/
/source/server/**/coverage/
/source/server/**/.cache/
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/pnpm-debug.log*

# Server / Python
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.venv/
**/venv/

# Server / .NET
**/bin/
**/obj/

# 本地环境与密钥
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.*.example

# 日志与临时文件
**/logs/
**/*.log
**/*.tmp
**/*.temp
**/*.bak
**/*.swp
**/*~

# 操作系统文件
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
